ss blend of space, privacy, and luxury. The lower level features a spacious living & dining area with a grand balcony, while the upper level hosts two elegant bedrooms with private sit-outs.\n\nWhat truly sets this home apart is the private internal elevator — a rare luxury that redefines convenience and exclusivity.\nWith abundant natural light, premium layout planning, and top-class amenities, this residence is crafted for those who expect more from their home.\n\n💰 Price: ₹9.49 Cr\n\n📲 For site visit & full details:\n📞 7021521006 / 9867892102\n\n🤝 Credit: @rk.ravikewalramani\n\n#AndheriWest #VersovaLiving\n#MumbaiLuxuryHomes #DuplexLiving\n#LuxuryRealEstateIndia](https://scontent.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/656641289_18026715416647370_6820268558299248889_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=103&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzIifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=ZaJ_6hFlupQQ7kNvwEDm37y&_nc_oc=Adp_HQWANROgG4JUg0lMEneehu2ldpJuWXudeNhTyIBtY1z_sFz5jVjR8iL7Gp_6hPc&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=WdxnxMofSNYVd3maequVYw&_nc_ss=7fa8c&oh=00_AQKzUaDZAjSZk7jeQ2iiV8JF6vIAU2Vabb0N1XPJleQBLw&oe=6AA5ADC9)\n\n5,982\n\nStep into elevated living with this stunning 3BHK duplex in Versova, Andheri West ✨ Spread across approx. 1600+ sq.ft, this thoughtfully designed home offers a seamless blend of space, privacy, and luxury. The lower level features a spacious living & dining area with a grand balcony, while the upper level hosts two elegant bedrooms with private sit-outs. What truly sets this home apart is the private internal elevator — a rare luxury that redefines convenience and exclusivity. With abundant natural light, premium layout planning, and top-class amenities, this residence is crafted for those who expect more from their home. 💰 Price: ₹9.49 Cr 📲 For site visit & full details: 📞 7021521006 / 9867892102 🤝 Credit: @rk.ravikewalramani #AndheriWest #VersovaLiving #MumbaiLuxuryHomes #DuplexLiving #LuxuryRealEstateIndia]